      "quote": "Identifying existing approaches used to evaluate the sustainability of evidence-based interventions in healthcare: an integrative review Check for updates",
      "reason": "The title identifies the study as an 'integrative review' rather than explicitly identifying it as a 'systematic review' as the checklist requires."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Identifying existing approaches used to evaluate the sustainability of evidence-based interventions in healthcare: an integrative review Check for updates",
      "reason": "The title specifies the main objective and scope — evaluating the sustainability of evidence-based interventions (EBIs) in healthcare — which provides key information about the review question (intervention and setting)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Identifying existing approaches used to evaluate the sustainability of evidence-based interventions in healthcare: an integrative review Check for updates",
